  "question": {
    "text": "A wire is bent in the shape of a right angled triangle and is placed in front of a concave mirror of focal length <math><mi>f</mi></math> , as shown in the figure. Which of the figures shown in the four options qualitatively represent(s) the shape of the image of the bent wire? (These figures are not to scale.)\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/zdlebafjspchplpzocoumcmlilmqyokvxexuckaznlkjuinmyg.jpeg\"/>",
